                <pb facs="0949" n="821" sameAs="frus:frus1928v01/pg821"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.79620 Boeing Airplane Co./19: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Ambassador in
                        Argentina</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Bliss</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-02-10T14:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">February 10,
                                1928—2 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>8. Your 10, February 9, 6 p.m. (1) Yes, if invited to do so. (2) Date of arrival
                    will be communicated to you by Embassy at Rio de Janeiro. (3) He plans to fly
                    from Rio de Janeiro to Buenos Aires and thence to Santiago in order to
                    demonstrate capabilities of machines.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Olds</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
